# Generated Project Smoke

This page is for **this generated project**, not the Riso maintainer repo.
Do not run `scripts/render-samples.sh` or `scripts/ci/render_matrix.py` here.

| Surface | When it applies | Smoke commands |
|---------|-----------------|----------------|
| Toolchain | always | `mise install` (pins are in `mise.toml`; generated Node is 20) |
| Python quality | Python CLI/API/MCP or Sphinx | `uv sync --group quality`<br>`uv run task quality` |
| Python tests | Python track | `uv run pytest` |
| CLI | `cli_module=enabled` and `python` in `cli_languages` | `uv sync --group cli`<br>`uv run pytest tests/test_cli.py` |
| FastAPI | `api_module=enabled` and `python` in `api_languages` | `uv sync --group api_python`<br>`uv run pytest tests/api/` |
| Node API | `api_module=enabled` and `node` in `api_languages` | `pnpm --filter api-node test` |
| TypeScript MCP | `mcp_module=enabled` and `typescript` in `mcp_languages` | `pnpm --filter @{{ package_name }}/mcp-server test` |
| Docs | `docs_module=enabled` | `just docs-build` or the framework `pnpm`/`sphinx-build` command |

Use `uv run` for every Python command. Use `riso migrate --dry-run` on a
1.x answers file before `riso update` if you are upgrading this project.
